  "description": "Built to perform but priced just right\nWith its super low centre of gravity and Whyte Total Geometry handling – that combine to deliver you exceptional confidence and capability – the E-160 S has all the unique Whyte engineering innovations of the E-160 platform – tilted motor, large 750Wh in-tube battery, class-leading reliability and impeccable weather-proofing – wrapped up in a high value build that will help you break barriers without breaking the bank.\n\nHighlights\n– Optimised low centre of gravity gives you exceptional handling.\n– 160mm front + 155mm rear suspension travel is capable for everything.\n– Multi-butted 6061 T-6 aluminium hydroformed frame is built to last.\n– Bosch Performance CX 85Nm motor (600W peak power) for class-leading performance.\n– 750Wh battery gives you the range to ride further for longer.\n– 29er wheels front and rear (size M-XL); 27.5in wheels (size XS-S) for balanced handling.\n\nEngineered to unlock your potential\nWith its huge 750Wh battery and high power 85Nm Bosch Performance Line CX motor, our E-160 S ensures you're geared up for maximum enjoyment on the trails, wherever you go. We've also fitted exactly the componentry you need to inspire you to take your riding further: fully wireless and electronic SRAM AXS GX 1x12 gearing delivers instant shifting through all conditions, custom-tuned RockShox suspension keeps you connected and in control on the trail, and four-piston SRAM brakes deliver reliable power through all weathers.",
